the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move place with *a thing* and *a second thing* is made; known as place.

the fluents are:
    *a thing* cell *a second thing* with *a role*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *an id* line count *a role* with *a num*; known as line_count.
    *a role* is the num letter lines of *a num*; known as num_letter_lines.
    *a role* is the num number lines of *a num*; known as num_number_lines.
    *a role* is the num vertical lines of *a num*; known as num_vertical_lines.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move place with *a thing* and *a second thing* is legal; known as legal_place.
    *a thing* is the num lines of *a second thing*; known as num_lines.
    *an id* is the one short of line majority of *a thing*; known as one_short_of_line_majority.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *a row* is line id.
    *an id* in line *a thing* with *a second thing*.
    *an id* inrow *a row* with *a col*.
    *an id* incol *a row* with *a col*.
    *a row* is a row.
    *a col* is a col.
    *a ver* is a ver.
    *an id* inver *a thing* with *a second thing*.
    the oob of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the maj of *an id* is *a majreq*.
    the succ of *an oneshort* is *a majreq*.
    the scoremap of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    *a thing* plus *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.

the knowledge base lines includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/lines.hrf".

