the move place with a thing and a second thing is legal at a time if
    the oob of the thing is the second thing
    and it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with red at the time
    and it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with blue at the time.

the goal of a role is a number at a time if
    the role is the num letter lines of a num at the time
    and the role is the num number lines of a second num at the time
    and the role is the num vertical lines of a third num at the time
    and the num plus the second num with the third num with a thing
    and the scoremap of the thing is the number.

the game is terminal at a time if
    red is the num lines of a thing at the time
    and blue is the num lines of a second thing at the time
    and plus(_180710,_180728,27).

a thing is the num lines of a second thing at a time if
    the thing is the num letter lines of a num at the time
    and the thing is the num number lines of a second num at the time
    and the thing is the num vertical lines of a third num at the time
    and the num plus the second num with the third num with the second thing.

an id is the one short of line majority of a thing at a time if
    the maj of the id is a majreq
    and the succ of an oneshort is the majreq
    and the id line count the thing with the oneshort at the time
    and it is not the case that the id line count the thing with the majreq at the time.

